cking (Version Control)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RACE_CONDITION_PREVENTION_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A version column prevents lost updates when multiple processes modify the same product record concurrently."}, {"id": "race_condition_prevention_guide_order_hash_duplicate_prevention", "label": "Order Hash Duplicate Prevention", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RACE_CONDITION_PREVENTION_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each order gets a unique hash from user id, cart contents, and timestamp so duplicate orders from repeated 'Buy' clicks are rejected via the orders.order_hash unique key."}, {"id": "race_condition_prevention_guide_processing_locks", "label": "Processing Locks (order_process lock key)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "RACE_CONDITION_PREVENTION_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A per-user lock key with a 30-second expiry ensures a user can only process one order at a time, preventing concurrent duplicate processing while avoiding indefinite deadlocks."}, {"id": "race_condition_prevention_guide_process_order_race_safe", "label": "process_order_race_safe.php", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "RACE_CONDITION_PREVENTION_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "race_condition_prevention_guide_process_order", "label": "process_order.php (standard checkout)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "RACE_CONDITION_PREVENTION_GUIDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "race_condition_prevention_guide_test_race_conditions_php", "label": "test_race_conditions.php", "file_type": "code